<title>FRANCE: CPR first half profits rise.</title>
<headline>CPR first half profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					  183.0  vs	     142.2</p>
<p>    Net before goodwill amortisation   207.8  vs	     167.8</p>
<p>    Net banking income		   1,107.6  vs	     909.8</p>
<p>    Sharesholders equity		 4,387.0  vs	   3,576.0</p>
<p>NOTE - French bank CPR gave the results in a statement.</p>
</text>
